{"suttaId":"an3.153","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-iii","vriCode":"s0402m2.mul","paras":[1256,1257],"vripara":"154"},"segments":{"an3.153:0.3":"Catutthakhatasuttaṃ","an3.153:1.1":"“Tīhi, bhikkhave … pe … asucinā kāyakammena, asucinā vacīkammena, asucinā manokammena … pe ….","an3.153:2.1":"“Tīhi, bhikkhave … pe … sucinā kāyakammena, sucinā vacīkammena, sucinā manokammena – imehi kho, bhikkhave, tīhi dhammehi samannāgato paṇḍito viyatto sappuriso akkhataṃ anupahataṃ attānaṃ pariharati, anavajjo ca hoti ananuvajjo ca viññūnaṃ, bahuñca puññaṃ pasavatī”ti.","an3.153:2.4":"Aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Mp-iii","bookName":"Tikanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0402a.att","from":978,"to":979,"paras":[{"para":978,"vripara":"147-155","refs":["an3.153:1"],"lines":["147-155. Pañcamassa paṭhame <b>yathābhataṃ nikkhitto</b>ti yathā ānetvā ṭhapito.","Dutiye <b>sāvajjenā</b>ti sadosena.","Tatiye <b>visamenā</b>ti sapakkhalanena.","<b>Samenā</b>ti apakkhalanena.","Catutthe <b>asucinā</b>ti gūthasadisena aparisuddhena amejjhena.","<b>Sucinā</b>ti parisuddhena mejjhena.","Pañcamādīni uttānāneva."],"lineRefs":[["an3.153:1"],["an3.153:1"],["an3.153:1"],["an3.153:1"],["an3.153:1"],["an3.153:1"],["an3.153:1"]]},{"para":979,"vripara":null,"refs":["an3.153:1"],"lines":["Pubbaṇhasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["an3.153:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-iii","bookName":"Tikanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0402t.tik","from":1009,"to":1011,"paras":[{"para":1009,"vripara":"147-156","refs":["an3.153:1"],"lines":["147-156. Maṅgalavaggo uttānatthoyeva."],"lineRefs":[["an3.153:1"]]},{"para":1010,"vripara":null,"refs":["an3.153:1"],"lines":["Tatiyapaṇṇāsakaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["an3.153:1"]]},{"para":1011,"vripara":null,"refs":["an3.153:1"],"lines":["(16)6. Acelakavaggavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["an3.153:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
